          "text": "SRT juxtaposes KRW200m / KRW70m annual salary = 2.857y, called about three years, with KRW4.5m monthly purchases. At KRW4.5m/month KRW200m takes 44.444 months (~3.70y), or 45 instalments with a partial last one. After 36 months only KRW162m is deployed and KRW38m remains. These are different pacing proxies; original audio/slides not independently validated.",
